---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us"
  description="Wild Excursions is a small-group adventure travel company connecting travelers with the world's wildest, most remote places."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">About Wild Excursions</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      Wild Excursions was founded on a simple idea: the best travel experiences happen in small groups, led by people
      who actually know the land. We run expeditions to some of the most remote and biodiverse places on the planet —
      from the Amazon rainforest to the Patagonian ice fields to the dunes of the Sahara.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      Every tour is led by local guides with years of experience in their region, and every itinerary is built around
      responsible, low-impact travel — supporting community-run lodges and local conservation efforts along the way.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Our Values</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      <li>Small groups — most trips cap at 10 travelers.</li>
      <li>Local expertise — every guide is from the region they lead you through.</li>
      <li>Responsible travel — we prioritize partners with strong conservation and community ties.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>
